Mother: My son! I can't find him! He was here a minute ago!

4
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:15.000
Narrator: A mother runs up to Faisal - her son was here a minute ago, and now he's gone.

5
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:17.900
Narrator: Every second feels like an hour to her.

6
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:19.800
Narrator: What should Faisal do first?

